    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Pact Sealed in Steam and Shadow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed Pact</i> is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder where you forge your strategy \u2014 but not all forces obey your command. Summon autonomous minions who fight by your side as you ascend through shifting paths, ancient machines, and cursed relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Build Your Deck</strong> \u2013 Draft cards, upgrade abilities, and craft deadly combos</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Unleash Unruly Allies</strong> \u2013 Summoned minions act independently, creating unpredictable synergy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Discover Powerful Relics</strong> \u2013 Each run brings new relics, events, and tactical twists</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Navigate a Dynamic Map</strong> \u2013 Face choices, elite foes, and branching encounters every step of the way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Slay-the-Spire</i> and enriched with a steampunk-fantasy world, Unsealed Pact rewards careful planning, reactive thinking, and the courage to embrace chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcec Wishlist now and be the first to unseal your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Pact Sealed in Steam and Shadow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed Pact</i> is a tactical roguelike deckbuilder where you forge your strategy \u2014 but not all forces obey your command. Summon autonomous minions who fight by your side as you ascend through shifting paths, ancient machines, and cursed relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Build Your Deck</strong> \u2013 Draft cards, upgrade abilities, and craft deadly combos</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Unleash Unruly Allies</strong> \u2013 Summoned minions act independently, creating unpredictable synergy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Discover Powerful Relics</strong> \u2013 Each run brings new relics, events, and tactical twists</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Navigate a Dynamic Map</strong> \u2013 Face choices, elite foes, and branching encounters every step of the way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Slay-the-Spire</i> and enriched with a steampunk-fantasy world, Unsealed Pact rewards careful planning, reactive thinking, and the courage to embrace chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcec Wishlist now and be the first to unseal your fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
